	<Item Name="GDS" Type="String" />
	<Item Name="title" Type="String">RNA-seq profiling of A549 cells with sgRNA knockouts that confer prexasertib resistance</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">A549 cells with FOXM1 or LIN54 sgRNA knockout, which confers resistance to the CHK1 inhibitor prexasertib, were generated. These cells and control (empty vector) cells were synchronized in S phase, released for 1 hour and treated with 100 nM prexasertib or DMSO (vehicle) for 2 hours. RNA-seq profiling was performed to identify drug-induced perturbations in gene expression in these cells.</Item>
